{
  "project": "makie-demos",
  "type": "architecture-infographic",
  "language": "zh-CN",
  "thesis": "makie-demos 是一个基于 CairoMakie 的 12 幅发布级透明 PNG 演示集合，具备统一主题系统、DEMOS 字典注册、像素级验证流水线与 JSON 清单输出。",
  "narrative_sections": [
    "01 · 项目定位：主题系统 → 场景函数 → 渲染 → 验证 四环节",
    "02 · 主题系统：apply_theme!/header!/Axis/Colorbar 与 GLMakie 备选后端",
    "03 · 十二场景四大家族：3D/体、统计/矩阵、流/网络、时间/极坐标；DEMOS 字典 + catalog.json 元数据",
    "04 · 渲染与验证流水线：apply_theme → 构建场景图 → save PNG → validate_png 三门槛 → JSON manifest",
    "05 · 入口与产物：tools/render.jl、out/ 目录、test/runtests.jl"
  ],
  "source_files": [
    "src/MakieDemos.jl",
    "tools/render.jl",
    "catalog.json",
    "test/runtests.jl",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "render": {
    "engine": "xelatex + tikz",
    "engine_version": "XeTeX 3.141592653-2.6-0.999995 (TeX Live 2023)",
    "backend": "Cairo/PDF via pdftocairo for SVG/PNG",
    "build_command": "xelatex -interaction=nonstopmode architecture-infographic.tex"
  },
